OL,3,GNEWSASwinney backs Flynn in ferry gas
OL,4,Aleak row and says 'nobody's perfect'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister John Swinney has backed
OL,7,FStephen Flynn in the row over whether
OL,8,Fthe transport secretary had been
OL,9,Fbriefed about a gas leak on a CalMac
OL,10,Fferry.
OL,12,FSpeaking to the BBC's Laura Kuenssberg
OL,13,Fprogramme in an interview to be
OL,14,Fbroadcast on Sunday, Swinney said
OL,15,Femails showed Flynn had not been
OL,16,Fbriefed ahead of a Holyrood committee
OL,17,Fmeeting last month.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
