OL,3,GNEWSASwinney backs Flynn in ferry gas
OL,4,Aleak row and says 'nobody's perfect'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister said he had
OL,7,Fconfidence in his transport secretary,
OL,8,Fwho "recognised that he should have
OL,9,Fbeen across an issue to be in front of
OL,10,Fthe transport committee and he remedied
OL,11,Fthat right away".
OL,13,FSwinney added: "Nobody's perfect,
OL,14,Fnobody's infallible".
